SUMMARY:Boogie for Good
DESCRIPTION:Boogie for Good brings our community together for music\, celebration of our diversity and a renewed spirit of hope for what we can build together for our future. 🎶🌲. Your RSVP helps us plan a safe\, welcoming event for us all to reconnect as a community and to have positive expression of our collective experience of life and each other. \nBy registering\, you support Audacity Rising Inc.’s mission to build confidence\, leadership\, and renewal of a sense of community for us all—especially those in underserved neighborhoods.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/boogie-for-good/
