SUMMARY:Spike Sikes & The Get Real Gone
DESCRIPTION:$15 General Admission\nDoors at 7:30pm.\nShow from 8:15-10:30pm with one intermission\nEarlybirds!\n$3 off each ticket when you use the code earlybird17 at checkout. Offer ends May 17th.\nPromo Codes are not applicable at the door.\nCodes are not case sensitive\, but must be typed as one word. \nSpike’s love of singer-songwriters on the jazzier side of folk & blues finds a unique outlet in The Get Real Gone. In addition to Spike on vocals & guitar\, the band features Dylan Juhan on upright bass\, Mingo Lewis Jr. on percussion and Ray Fernandez on saxophone. The acoustic framework allows them to create an organic music that is a vibe unto itself. They released their self-titled debut in 2025\, a collection of originals and a few choice covers from the world of jazz\, blues\, and poetry. \nhttps://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3rxVIMq-455o8kD7yTIoEg \nWelcome2021 \n \nRecommended If You Like: Tim Buckley\, Jayne Cortez\, Richie Havens
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/spike-sikes-the-get-real-gone/
LOCATION:The Lost Church Santa Rosa\, 576 Ross Street\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
