SUMMARY:Tuesdays in the Plaza: The Sun Kings (Beatles Tribute)
DESCRIPTION:Our weekly summer concerts in the Healdsburg Plaza from 6:00 p.m. to 8:00 p.m. provide an eclectic and unique line-up of bands\, and have been assembled to please a wide array of musical interests. Food vendors will be on-hand to offer locally sourced food for sale starting at 5:00 p.m. with the music beginning at 6:00 p.m. \nAbout the band: Enjoy the music created by one of the most influential bands of our time. You’ll hear many of the Fab Four’s #1 hits\, B sides and deep tracks – all performed with attention to detail duplicating their tight harmonies\, fancy guitar work and solid backbeat. In short\, that signature Beatles sound! \nBased in Connecticut\, these 5 lads\, started out a few years back perfecting their music and vocal harmonies as they grew a list of songs now nearing 100! Performing at special events\, outdoor concerts\, libraries\, restaurants and music festivals is the primary focus as their following grows with each performance. “No wigs\, costumes\, backing tracks or gimmicks here…. just 5 guys who sing and play like The Beatles!”
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/tuesdays-in-the-plaza-the-sun-kings-beatles-tribute/
LOCATION:Healdsburg Plaza\, Plaza St. & Center St.\, Healdsburg\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
