SUMMARY:Wines & Sunsets at Paradise with The BlueByrds
DESCRIPTION:WINES & SUNSETS IS BACK!! Come Paradise with us and join us for Wines & Sunsets 🍷 A Wednesday night concert series in Paradise – featuring a rotating schedule of LIVE music and local food vendors! We’ve got a great line-up this year with some new and exciting acts and we can’t wait to see you. Buy a season pass and see every show with your friends and family! Wednesday May 27th enjoy live tunes by BlueByrds and food by Adobos N More!
